TOKEN tinybird_read READ

DESCRIPTION >
    Raw Cloudflare GraphQL analytics responses for every *.pollinations.ai host, appended daily
    by .github/workflows/data-sync-cloudflare-traffic-tinybird.yml. The Free plan keeps
    per-request detail for 30 days only, so body is stored exactly as returned for later
    analysis. Real clients only; no IP, user-agent string or free-form path.
    page_views (host ''): HTML pages of pollinations.ai, www and enter by page, country, device,
    browser. host_views (one row per host): all requests to that host by country, device,
    browser and content type. Counts are Cloudflare's sampled estimates.

SCHEMA >
    `dataset` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.dataset`,
    `date` Date `json:$.date`,
    `host` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.host`,
    `fetched_at` DateTime `json:$.fetched_at`,
    `body` String `json:$.body`

ENGINE "MergeTree"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "dataset, date, host, fetched_at"
